      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْصَعُ</span></b>  A boy <i>having the prepuce appearing</i> (S,
O, K) <i>withdrawn from the glans.</i> (S, O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَصْعَآءُ</span> [fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَفْصَعُ</span>] signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَأْرَةُ</span> [app. as
n. un., or fem., of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَأْرُ</span> q. v.; but it may here
have some other of the meanings expl. in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فأر</span>].
(IAar, K.)

